    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p>The Ramz Al Rayyan project is a residential development located in Riyadh&#39;s Al Rayyan District with a built-up area of 5,500 square meters (sqms), featuring nine fully integrated smart villas with diverse designs and sizes ranging from 273 to 319 sqms.</p>\r\n",
